		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/app.bsky.feed.post/3liypy3wojs2n",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg/post/3liypy3wojs2n",
			"author": {
				"name": "Matt Kane",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/bafkreic4mwsbm2tmuonamj4jq4kcjofk35bwics2f4oorp57f3cdfusjwu"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-25T11:09:04.492Z",
			"content": "<p>I'm not sure the existence of a Starlight plugin for it really counts as \"full steam ahead\". It makes it easier for people who want it to add it to their own docs sites. If it *does* get wider adoption and would be helpful to users then maybe we'll add it to the Astro docs site but not right now.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:uthwv2jcpcccf4ec2bzsavg7/app.bsky.feed.post/3liysm7ulkc2f",
