		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3liyzzmcgmk2e",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:uthwv2jcpcccf4ec2bzsavg7/app.bsky.feed.post/3liysm7ulkc2f",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3liyzzmcgmk2e",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-25T14:08:52.627Z",
			"content": "<p>hear me out: what if we call it sitemap.txt and then we put xml in it</p>\n<p>hear me out again: what if we put markdown in robots.txt</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz2dlbgnc2e",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/app.bsky.feed.post/3liypy3wojs2n",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3liz2dlbgnc2e",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-25T14:14:27.089Z",
			"content": "<p>a starlight plugin from a core maintainer of astro, that shows up as result #2 on a search for \"llms.txt\" on npm? if y’all are hesitant to have it framed this way, I’d be curious to learn more about why!</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz34zstg22m",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz2dlbgnc2e",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg/post/3liz34zstg22m",
			"author": {
				"name": "Matt Kane",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/bafkreic4mwsbm2tmuonamj4jq4kcjofk35bwics2f4oorp57f3cdfusjwu"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-25T14:28:41.200Z",
			"content": "<p>I've nothing against llms.txt. The only reason I don't want it framed that way is because it's not true! Most Astro core maintainers have lots of our own projects. You could just as well say that Astro has gone all-in on Airtable because I made a loader for it.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:lgmfg3uvicfeuq56ohxqvfal/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz3afh47k2h",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/thealexlichter.com/post/3liz3afh47k2h",
			"author": {
				"name": "Alexander Lichter",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/thealexlichter.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:lgmfg3uvicfeuq56ohxqvfal/bafkreicijojfno74yatjtulcleu6mmn6g35pge2pxldxtspu2n6ralxiqy"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-25T14:30:34.063Z",
			"content": "<p>IMO it is good to have an easy integration for people building pages (and our own <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:6gbm7hkapyhjt2jghosdzwv2\">@nuxt.com</a> docs for example). It is an extra module on purpose right now, especially because the llms.txt \"proposal\" is still pending.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:4qy26t5ss4zosz2mi3hdzuq3/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz3bf2rb223",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz2dlbgnc2e",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/wes.dev/post/3liz3bf2rb223",
			"author": {
				"name": "Wes Souza",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/wes.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:4qy26t5ss4zosz2mi3hdzuq3/bafkreiebnoc2or7gnhhobwws44jrkrdb3htdtaqyf3ihkket5eyqnc3kz4"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-25T14:31:07.213Z",
			"content": "<p>When I read “full steam” I expected <a href=\"https://astro.build/llms.txt\">astro.build/llms.txt</a> to exist.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz3ixarb22e",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz34zstg22m",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3liz3ixarb22e",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-25T14:35:21.165Z",
			"content": "<p>I’ve now had three different Astro employees talk to me about this post on two different social networks so something isn’t quite matching up</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:dmgoddsemnyljdrp4jgt4dam/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz3tcwivs2m",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3liyzzmcgmk2e",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mwdelaney.me/post/3liz3tcwivs2m",
			"author": {
				"name": "Michael",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mwdelaney.me",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:dmgoddsemnyljdrp4jgt4dam/bafkreiceamr3su5jnraffld424q2i5vw3dap5aei43qliywmg7glbm6exi"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-25T14:41:08.956Z",
			"content": "<p>Decades of research and development into software that can spider and map the World Wide Web, and the new hotness needs a special file to understand your blog.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz3thsmys2m",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz3ixarb22e",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg/post/3liz3thsmys2m",
			"author": {
				"name": "Matt Kane",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/bafkreic4mwsbm2tmuonamj4jq4kcjofk35bwics2f4oorp57f3cdfusjwu"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-25T14:41:14.072Z",
			"content": "<p>Are we saying different things?</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:gotnvwkr56ibs33l4hwgfoet/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz3usag7s2o",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zeu.dev/post/3liz3usag7s2o",
			"author": {
				"name": "zeu",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zeu.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:gotnvwkr56ibs33l4hwgfoet/bafkreicoiamkuhof6bcon6ac2riq6vcpfj4wr7hvanfylbevnlqeuilkae"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-25T14:41:58.553Z",
			"content": "<p>software developers are by far the biggest users for AI chatbots and one of the biggest criticisms against using LLMs is hallucinations</p>\n<p>if ppl are gonna use LLMs to learn about web dev, i’d rather the data be accurate, and /llms.txt gives library authors control on what is being said by the bots</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz4a37upc2i",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:4qy26t5ss4zosz2mi3hdzuq3/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz3bf2rb223",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg/post/3liz4a37upc2i",
			"author": {
				"name": "Matt Kane",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/bafkreic4mwsbm2tmuonamj4jq4kcjofk35bwics2f4oorp57f3cdfusjwu"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-25T14:48:17.081Z",
			"content": "<p>Yes, that's what I would consider to be the main criterion. Even then it's a bit of a small thing to really qualify as \"full steam ahead\". We're also full steam ahead on webfinger, sitemap.xml and robots.txt</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:etets3mgjcnqvap6tnyjgkss/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz4oeiksc22",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:gotnvwkr56ibs33l4hwgfoet/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz3usag7s2o",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/griff.dev/post/3liz4oeiksc22",
			"author": {
				"name": "Griffin Wiebel",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/griff.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:etets3mgjcnqvap6tnyjgkss/bafkreidcnpt2hlr2f357gre5a3toqhb2nljwz2cyowetsoxdyou3owjdxq"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-25T14:56:16.537Z",
			"content": "<p>Maybe it's unclear to me, but haven't these popular LLMs already been trained on public data? And what's to stop them from continuing to scrape and index public data rather than using these generated txt files? Sounds like just another thing to train on.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz4utirfs2e",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:dmgoddsemnyljdrp4jgt4dam/app.bsky.feed.post/3liz3tcwivs2m",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3liz4utirfs2e",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-25T14:59:53.628Z",
			"content": "<p>“Converting complex HTML pages with navigation, ads, and JavaScript into LLM-friendly plain text is both difficult and imprecise.” on <a href=\"https://llmstxt.org/\">llmstxt.org</a> 😅</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
